#: ../../library/network.LAN.rst:181
msgid ""
"Pass to ``ref_clk_mode`` so the RMII reference clock is driven by the MAC. "
"mimxrt port only."
msgstr ""
"Diberikan ke ``ref_clk_mode`` agar clock referensi RMII dikendalikan oleh "
"MAC. Khusus port mimxrt."
